message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated article."
title: "VDGCI: analysis pipeline for viral-derived DNA and antiphage defense content in bacterial genomes"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and statistical analysis code for quantifying integrated viral
  sequence and antiphage defense-system content across bacterial genomes,
  including provirus detection, defense-system annotation and localization,
  taxon-resolved enrichment estimation and positional analyses.
type: software
authors:
